  <name>php-vitexsoftware-ease-bootstrap5-widgets</name>
  <summary>Bootstrap 5 UI widgets for the EasePHP framework</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      A collection of Bootstrap 5 UI widgets for the EasePHP framework,
      ready to use in PHP web applications.
    </p>
    <p>Included widgets:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>BsIcon — Bootstrap Icons tag wrapper</li>
      <li>Toggle — Bootstrap 5 switch/toggle input</li>
      <li>Selectizer — searchable select element</li>
      <li>MainPageMenu — large-icon navigation menu</li>
      <li>LangSelect — language selector dropdown</li>
      <li>LangLinks — language selector navigation links</li>
      <li>LoginForm — Bootstrap 5 login form</li>
      <li>PasswordInputShowHide — password field with show/hide toggle</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
